        "detailed_description": "<h1>社区</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群：688982646 <br>抖音：62217831666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiktok:  zngame001</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YouTube:  @ZNgame-01</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Boom! Smash it!&quot; is a fun driving escape game: hop in your car, swerve to avoid roadblocks, and mow down all zombies to reach the escape gate! Here’s the twist: once the game starts, your car cruises forward automatically—you only need to nudge it left or right to steer. With its laid-back, cheerful vibe, we hope it brings you heaps of gaming joy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/b50f723a46afc528b048f2d4dd10e8ab.poster.avif?t=1765126938\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/b50f723a46afc528b048f2d4dd10e8ab.webm?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/b50f723a46afc528b048f2d4dd10e8ab.mp4?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Single Player Mode, the ever-changing levels and tricky obstacle designs mean you’ll need to dodge nimbly while plowing through zombies. But we know a pro like you won’t break a sweat! And if things get tough? No worries—there’s a restart button ready to hit. Let’s hit refresh and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/febed06987f640c11312a0dbd036655c.poster.avif?t=1765126938\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/febed06987f640c11312a0dbd036655c.webm?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/febed06987f640c11312a0dbd036655c.mp4?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While dodging obstacles and mowing down zombies, keep an eye on your teammate too! We’re pretty sure you don’t want to end up with both cars crashing and exploding—after all, that would wipe out all the progress you’ve already made (and you’ll have to restart from the beginning!!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/6a0768f16e9a8e99bae5b55e89be2d42.poster.avif?t=1765126938\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/6a0768f16e9a8e99bae5b55e89be2d42.webm?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/6a0768f16e9a8e99bae5b55e89be2d42.mp4?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve crafted a bunch of simple yet fun little levels, each paired with unique obstacles and roads. Our hope? That every time you play, there’s a fresh spark of surprise waiting for you! From the bottom of our hearts, we just want you to have a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/4302dbd2a701b6e624192c3845645d66.poster.avif?t=1765126938\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/4302dbd2a701b6e624192c3845645d66.webm?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/4302dbd2a701b6e624192c3845645d66.mp4?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our intuitive settings and button system make jumping into the game a breeze—so you can steer and control your vehicle with total ease. Even better, using a controller to navigate the interface (no mouse clicks needed!) lets your hands relax, turning every minute of gameplay into pure comfort. Enjoy the ride!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/a6e49fb1af557461cff42a2dff3741a3.poster.avif?t=1765126938\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/a6e49fb1af557461cff42a2dff3741a3.webm?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/a6e49fb1af557461cff42a2dff3741a3.mp4?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Boom! Smash it!&quot; is a fun driving escape game: hop in your car, swerve to avoid roadblocks, and mow down all zombies to reach the escape gate! Here’s the twist: once the game starts, your car cruises forward automatically—you only need to nudge it left or right to steer. With its laid-back, cheerful vibe, we hope it brings you heaps of gaming joy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/b50f723a46afc528b048f2d4dd10e8ab.poster.avif?t=1765126938\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/b50f723a46afc528b048f2d4dd10e8ab.webm?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/b50f723a46afc528b048f2d4dd10e8ab.mp4?t=1765126938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Single Player Mode, the ever-changing levels and tricky obstacle designs mean you’ll need to dodge nimbly while plowing through zombies. But we know a pro like you won’t break a sweat! And if things get tough? No worries—there’s a restart button ready to hit. Let’s hit refresh and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/febed06987f640c11312a0dbd036655c.poster.avif?t=1765126938\" width=1080 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146960/extras/febed06987f640c11312a0dbd036655c.webm?t